    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like trauma or being \"overwhelmed.\" it feels like truth. i just watched him suffer and felt nothing until it was over. it's like i’m not even a real person, just a void. how can someone like that even pretend to be a part of society? i feel like a parasite just existing.",
